# The remote's Assistant button as F12, which the system leaves to apps: RemoteKeyService then opens
# the house assistant (home.json keys "142"). Applied per remote by tools/assistant-key.sh on.
# Linux keys KEY_SEARCH 217, KEY_VOICECOMMAND 582, KEY_ASSISTANT 583, and the same buttons as HID usages
# (Bluetooth remotes): AC Search 0x0c0221, Voice Command 0x0c00cf.
type OVERLAY

map key 217 F12
map key 582 F12
map key 583 F12
map key usage 0x0c0221 F12
map key usage 0x0c00cf F12
